{"Title":"An Act protecting public higher education student information","BillNumber":"S844","DocketNumber":"SD343","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JRO0","Name":"Jacob R. Oliveira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T15:43:22.19"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JRO0","Name":"Jacob R. Oliveira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T15:43:22.19"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2023-03-17T16:50:03.3433333"},{"Id":"RLR0","Name":"Rebecca L. Rausch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RLR0","ResponseDate":"2023-07-06T13:51:36.93"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S844/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Oliveira, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 844) of Jacob R. Oliveira for legislation relative to certain higher education records under the public records law.  Higher Education.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 66 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding a new section:\r\n\tSection 22. Public institutions of higher education, as set forth in section 5 of chapter 15A, and municipally owned institutions of higher education, shall not be required to produce education records, including information designated by the public institution of higher education as directory information, as defined under the Family Educational and Privacy Rights Act, 20 U.S.C. section 1232 (g). This section shall not apply to requests from federal, state, or municipal agencies.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}